OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear skies  
OL,6,Fthis evening and remaining dry and     
OL,7,Flargely clear overnight. Quickly       
OL,8,Fturning cold with a widespread and     
OL,9,Flocally sharp frost developing         
OL,10,Fovernight. Patchy freezing fog         
OL,11,Fdeveloping in the countryside.         
OL,13,CSaturday:FA cold and frosty start for  
OL,14,Fmost with any freezing fog gradually   
OL,15,Fclearing through the morning.          
OL,16,FOtherwise a largely sunny albeit       
OL,17,Fchilly day with a freshening easterly  
OL,18,Fbreeze later.                          
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
