OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA       
OL,6,Fcloudier day on Sunday but probably    
OL,7,Fremaining dry with bright spells.      
OL,8,FTurning more changeable into next week 
OL,9,Fwith spells of windier and wetter      
OL,10,Fweather. Slowly becoming a bit milder. 
